        <characteristic name="LD" typeId="c751-ec1f-edb8-fd83">8</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Litanies of Faith" id="f260-a72c-51aa-d200" hidden="false" page="43" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">A character leading a squad in the Scared Rites with the Litanies of Faith can roll two dice and choose which result to apply</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Book of St. Lucius" id="a8e4-6aed-234f-bb6e" hidden="false" page="43" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Any troops within 8&quot; of the character at the start of the rally phase may use the character&apos;s Leadership value for their test to rally. They may attempt to rally even if they are not able to do so.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Phial of Dolan" id="8c0d-1f74-dfc1-346f" hidden="false" page="43" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">The character may drink the contents of the phial at the start of any turn. For the rest of the player&apos;s turn the character&apos;s Strength and Toughness are increased by D3 each (roll separetely), to a max of 10

1 use only</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Tears of the Emperor" id="e2f3-32ff-1c39-38c7" hidden="false" page="43" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">The phial can be thrown just like a grenade and uses a 2&quot; blast marker. Any daemon affected takes a wound on a 4+ and receives no saving throw for its daemonic aura

1 use only</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Cloak of St. Aspira" id="7f8b-af85-329c-5af7" hidden="false" page="43" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">A Character wearing the cloak may add +1 to any armour saving throws they make due to physical armour. This does not apply to saves from fields or saving throws of any other kind. Only one Cloak may be worn</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Staff of Belief" id="0369-cabb-1031-4a4b" hidden="false" page="44" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">The Staff is a close combat weapon and requires both hands to wield. It adds +3 to the user&apos;s Strength and may be used to parry. Daemons receive no daemonic aura for hits inflicted by a Staff of Belief</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Axe of Retribution" id="0849-14ef-df70-19ed" hidden="false" page="44" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="d8e8-6c66-f558-30ee" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Short range" typeId="a108-ac67-8c42-6bbb">CC Only</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Long Range" typeId="3acf-5fa0-de29-6094">CC Only</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Short &apos;To Hit’" typeId="bbc0-6de5-4dfa-9328">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Long &apos;To Hit’" typeId="10bb-0500-b03c-643c">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="e297-34fa-4b72-f0b6">6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="8978-f9c3-8957-1481">D6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Save Modifier" typeId="53ec-cd58-3d6e-c00d">-1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Armour Penetration" typeId="0530-f4b7-b7db-de67">2D6+D12+6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="9fb9-b2be-dfa5-713d">Close Combat</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Brazier of Holy Fire" id="8af7-8777-d677-7dcb" hidden="false" page="44" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="d8e8-6c66-f558-30ee" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Short range" typeId="a108-ac67-8c42-6bbb">CC Only</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Long Range" typeId="3acf-5fa0-de29-6094">CC Only</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Short &apos;To Hit’" typeId="bbc0-6de5-4dfa-9328">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Long &apos;To Hit’" typeId="10bb-0500-b03c-643c"/>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="e297-34fa-4b72-f0b6">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="8978-f9c3-8957-1481">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Save Modifier" typeId="53ec-cd58-3d6e-c00d">-3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Armour Penetration" typeId="0530-f4b7-b7db-de67">2D6+D3+5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="9fb9-b2be-dfa5-713d">Close Combat</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Medicus Ministorum" id="5ccc-64f9-cb76-71b6" hidden="false" page="44" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">If the character can reach a model in the same turn after it is wounded, there is a chance they can be healed. The character must spend their shooting phase and close combat phase doing nothing. At the end of the turn, if the character passes a Leadership test, he may heal 1 lost wound on the injured model. A model reduced to 0 wounds may be raised to 1 wound in this way. Character cannot heal themselves.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Praesidium Protectiva" id="e463-b880-a89d-9f96" hidden="false" page="44" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Requires a free hand to use, may parry a close combat blow made from within the character&apos;s front arc and confers an unmodified saving throw of a 4+ against close combat attacks. In addition, if a 6 is rolled for the saving throw the attacking model receives the hit instead, roll to wound and make saving throws as if the model were by its own weapon. 
Has no effect on shooting damage.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Simulacrum Imperialis" id="33a4-aeac-857c-f4d4" hidden="false" page="44" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
