    <profile name="Frateris Standard" id="fcba-c35a-f84e-4259" hidden="false" page="59" publicationId="cad3-a694-b720-6309" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Unit containing the Frateris Standard adds +1 to their combat score in the first round of any close combat. No effect on further rounds.

If the Standard Bearer is killed and the Frateris band is not broken another model will automatically pick up the banner. If the Banner Bearer falls and the other squad is broken the Banner is lost for the rest of the battle</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
