              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Declare at the start of a turn that you are using the Mantle. For the whole of that game turn, Helena may re-roll any failed save for her Rosarius. If the second roll fails she is wounded as normal. Once the power of the Mantle has been invoked it has no further effect.
Lasts 1 game turn only</characteristic>
