              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Any unit within 12&quot; of the Banner may roll 3 dice for any Leadership test required and choose the lowest 2. Any unit led by a character bearing the Banner may ignore nay close combat fumbles they roll and count any 6&apos;s they roll as a critical hit, not just subsequent 6&apos;s.</characteristic>
