              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Character carrying the banner causes Terror and is immune to Terror themselves. Any squads or models with a line of sight to the Icon count as having a Leadership of 10 may re-roll any fumbles in hand-to-hand combat (if another fumble is rolled it cannot be re-rolled).</characteristic>
