                <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Any fleeing friendly squad which can draw a line of sight to it when it rallies is treated as if it had rolled a double 1 - ie, it can take a normal turn as described on pg. 48 of the Rulebook.
